            "review_title": "Review at Shiba Sushi",
            "review_text": "Liệu N\nUnited States20 contributions\n0\nHonestly, I didn’t expect to find such fresh sashimi in Saigon. But WOW w Shiba Sushi , cheap, realy good\nMay 2025 • Family\nHonestly, I didn’t expect to find such fresh sashimi in Saigon.\nThe salmon was buttery, the wasabi real (finally!), and the vibe? Quiet and classy.\nShiba Sushi is a hidden gem\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 13, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
